---
/**
 * SkipLink — accessibility skip navigation component.
 *
 * Renders the first focusable element in the page: a visually hidden
 * link that becomes visible on keyboard focus, allowing keyboard and
 * screen-reader users to bypass repeated navigation.
 *
 * Styled via .skip-link in base.css.
 * Target anchor: #main-content on <main>.
 */
---
<a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
